{{root|ru|ine-pro|*h₃erbʰ-}}
{{inh+|ru|orv|робота}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*orbòta}}. {{surf|ru|роби́ть|-о́та}}. Cognate with {{cog|cu|работа}}, whence spelling. {{doublet|ru|ро́бот}}.

